      "transcript": [
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Hi, this is Summit Air. Is this Dennis?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Hi, I'd like to book my annual boiler tune-up.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Sure, let's get that booked. I've got you at 801 Fenimore Street in Brooklyn, is that still right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, that's right. It's the downstairs unit, so just ring the downstairs bell.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Got it, I'll note the downstairs bell. Let me check the availability for a tune-up. I have openings this afternoon or evening, tomorrow morning, afternoon or evening, and Thursday afternoon. Do any of those work for you?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "None of those work for me. I'm looking for a weekday morning next week. Do you have anything Monday or Tuesday morning?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Let me check next week's mornings. I can do tomorrow morning, Friday morning, or Monday morning, next week. Which day would you like?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Monday morning works. Let's do that.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Monday morning, the 9th, between 8 and 12. Before I book, I need to ask a couple of quick things. How long has the boiler been in, roughly?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "About eight years old. It's a gas boiler and it's running fine.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks. Anything the technician should know when they get there, like a gate code or a pet?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "No gate code and no pets. I work from home, so I'll be around. Just ring the downstairs bell when they arrive.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "I have your home at 801 Fenimore St, unit downstairs, Brooklyn, one one two zero six, and the best number is three four seven, five five five, zero one six two, is that right?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "Yes, that's all correct. That's the best number to reach me.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Should that address go on its own account, with you as a contact, or under your account?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "I'm not sure what you mean by that. I'm the owner, and I've used Summit Air before, so my account should already be under my name. Can you tell me what the difference is?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Since this is your own home and it's already on your account, choosing \"under your account\" is right. You're all set for Monday, November 9, with the technician arriving between 8 and 12. Anything else?",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "caller",
          "text": "That's perfect, thank you. Nothing else from me. Have a good day.",
          "said": null
        },
        {
          "role": "agent",
          "text": "Thanks for calling Summit Air. Have a great rest of your day.",
          "said": null
        }
      ],
