      "grader_notes": "The age turn (\"what's the system's rough age, and has anything been going wrong with it?\") asks two direct questions at once, with no soft \"if you know\"; the account question was unneeded since the address was already on file. The access question also re-asks about a buzzer after the caller had already explained the downstairs bell, and availability opened with exact windows rather than the general shape.",
      "reply_delay_p50_ms": 689.7542499937117,
